      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_immigrants_celebrating",
      "label": "Immigrants are mapped as celebratory citizens",
      "description": "The text 'immigrants' is positioned directly above the top image, which shows a diverse crowd of people joyfully holding American flags. This creates an analogical mapping where the textual label 'immigrants' is projected onto the visual entity 'immigrants_celebrating', implying that the people in the image are 'immigrants' and are being portrayed as happy, patriotic, and integrated members of society.",
